<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>编码器延迟 on 如是有为</title><link>https://sensor.fans/tags/%E7%BC%96%E7%A0%81%E5%99%A8%E5%BB%B6%E8%BF%9F/</link><description>Recent content in 编码器延迟 on 如是有为</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 08:21:20 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://sensor.fans/tags/%E7%BC%96%E7%A0%81%E5%99%A8%E5%BB%B6%E8%BF%9F/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>6000转，晚10微秒就差0.36°：你的编码器，读准了过去</title><link>https://sensor.fans/posts/xirxqy3qi7iilfb28zlega/</link><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 08:21:20 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://sensor.fans/posts/xirxqy3qi7iilfb28zlega/</guid><description>&lt;p>&lt;img src="https://sensor.fans/images/wx/c9583cc361bc89224ada0e1226c104bd.png" alt="6000转，晚10微秒就差0.36°：你的编码器，读准了过去" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
&lt;/p>
&lt;p>假设一份选型要求写着：角度精度优于0.1°。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>你拿着这个数挑编码器，对照手册，检查安装，做静态标定。轴停在那里，读数合格。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>然后电机转到6000 rpm。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>机器人关节的角度补偿，该补到电流采样，还是数据到达？</title><link>https://sensor.fans/posts/jyjsvcpkkip4leucs-jhsa/</link><pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 11:20:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://sensor.fans/posts/jyjsvcpkkip4leucs-jhsa/</guid><description>&lt;p>&lt;img src="https://sensor.fans/images/wx/2406c200b466688f5d085d016191fa31.png" alt="机器人关节的角度补偿，该补到电流采样，还是数据到达？" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
&lt;/p>
&lt;p>角度在0微秒测得，电流在10微秒采样，位置数据到18微秒才送到控制器。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;strong>做这次电流坐标变换，角度该向前推10微秒，还是18微秒？&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>两种做法只差8微秒。在6000 rpm下，却差了&lt;strong>0.288°机械角&lt;/strong>。&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>